<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The question dialog of the dialog kit (controller:
	     assets/root/nui_dialog_question.py): uiCommon.QuestionDialog and
	     QuestionDialog2. A modal; the accept button has the focus on each
	     show, so Enter accepts. The buttons call the caller's events and
	     leave the dialog open, as the legacy buttons do. Escape hides it, and
	     nui-escape-passes-key-down lets the legacy key handlers see the key
	     too, as under a legacy question: the game window ends its item drop
	     question and the inventory lock there. The look is
	     components/dialog.rcss's; dialog-question.rcss sets its spacing and
	     puts Yes before No, as legacy's. warn_line is the row a
	     QuestionDialog2.SetWarningLine marks (the point reset's
	     confirmation), -1 for none; its class reads only the index and a
	     top-level key, as a row of a list that can shrink must. The dialog
	     carries dialog-question--two with two lines (QuestionDialog2), whose
	     legacy board a skin may follow. -->
	<title>dialog-question</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="dialog-question.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-scrim nui-fx nui-escape-passes-key-down dialog-question" data-model="dialog_question">
	<div class="nui-window nui-fx nui-dialog nui-anim" id="dialog-question" data-class-dialog-question--two="size(lines) == 2">
		<div class="nui-window__body">
			<p class="nui-dialog__text" data-for="line : lines" data-class-nui-dialog__text--warning="it_index == warn_line">{{ line }}</p>
			<!-- CheckQuestionDialog's check box (the offline shop's "remove all
			     identical items"): a left press on the row flips it and the box
			     follows the model. -->
			<label id="dialog-question-check" class="nui-toggle dialog-question__check" data-if="check_on"
			       data-event-mousedown="check(ev.button)"><input type="checkbox" class="nui-toggle__input"
			       data-attrif-checked="checked"/><span class="nui-toggle__track nui-anim"><span
			       class="nui-toggle__knob nui-anim"></span></span><span class="nui-toggle__label">{{ check_text }}</span></label>
		</div>
		<div class="nui-window__footer nui-dialog__footer">
			<button id="dialog-question-cancel" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim" data-event-click="cancel()">{{ cancel_label }}</button>
			<!-- QuestionDialog3's third button (NOVA-189, NOVA-201), between
			     accept and cancel as legacy's. -->
			<button id="dialog-question-middle" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-anim" data-if="middle_on" data-event-click="middle()">{{ middle_label }}</button>
			<button id="dialog-question-accept" class="nui-button nui-button--medium nui-button--primary nui-anim" autofocus="autofocus" data-event-click="accept()">{{ accept_label }}</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
